// DRAFT patches for Module E. Each block names where it goes.

// ---- E.2 Organizational Qualities: add under the rating table (Cohesion 0 vs. E.12 Fracture) ----
A permanent Cohesion of 0 is a #emph[crisis] when a faction has fallen to it (E.12). A faction built at Cohesion 0 begins with its Fracture clock created and no automatic tick that turn.

// ---- E.6 Faction Support in Party Scenes: replace the last sentence of the Active Help bullet ----
A faction's accompanying NPC pays the Help cost from its own pools if it is built with them. An ordinary NPC has no pools and cannot Help (§6.1); an ally who can is a named NPC built with pools.

// ---- E.8 Adventures and Strategic Advantages: add at the end ----
#strong[One contribution.] If a PC endeavour does the work a faction's project action would do (the party sabotages the project itself), that endeavour replaces the faction's own roll for that project this turn. Never count both for the same work.

// ---- E.9 Commitments and Strain: add after the paragraph on additional major actions ----
#strong[Timing.] Strain from an additional or exceptional action is marked when the action is #emph[declared] (E.10, step 2), so that action and every other action that phase use the lowered rating.

// ---- E.10 World Turns, Opposition and disruption: add after the countermeasures sentence ----
Declare obstruction or countermeasures in step 2 as the faction's one major action. A faction that defends does not also advance its own project. If two clocks with contradictory result Truths complete in the same turn, neither result is established as written: the GM and players agree on a compromise Truth, and both factions are Strained.

// ---- E.10 World Turns: add under the cadence paragraph ----
#strong[With Module D.] The cadence is between adventures: one World Turn per stay. Strain (E.9), Fracture clocks (E.12) and project clocks count in World Turns. A long stay doesn't recover Strain faster, and a short one doesn't skip it.

// ---- E.11 Conflict, Objectives, and Pressure: replace the last sentence of the first paragraph ----
Use only core Disposition, scripting, Power, concessions and compromise; no other success or attribute systems apply.
